@startuml Sum_Ssfm_Errh_SecPError_Handler_SeqDiag


participant BswM as BswM
box SUM_SSFM
    participant Sum_Ssfm_Errh_SecPError_Handler as SecPHandler
    participant TBD as TBD
end box

BswM -> SecPHandler: Notification on a change in SecP error status
SecPHandler -> TBD: Aggregating the notification

@enduml 